# Secrets - MUST never enter an image layer.
# The Dockerfile used to `COPY . .` and then `COPY .env .env`, while this file
# excluded neither .env nor the Firebase service key: both were baked into the
# published layers. Secrets are injected at runtime now.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
firebaseservicekey.json
*serviceAccountKey*.json
*.pem
*.key

__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
env
.venv
venv/
.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
*.log
coverage
.cache
.pytest_cache
dist
build
tests
